The '''2026–27 [[Club América]] season''' is the club's 82nd consecutive season in the top-flight of Mexican football. In addition to the [[2026–27 Liga MX season|domestic league]], the club will also participate in the [[2026 Leagues Cup|Leagues Cup]] and the [[2027 CONCACAF Champions Cup|CONCACAF Champions Cup]].

This season will be the first since [[2021–22 Club América season|2021–22]] without [[Captain (association football)#Vice-captain|vice-captain]] [[Jonathan dos Santos]], who departed as a free agent following the expiration of his contract.

