== Pre-season and friendlies ==
On 9 June 2026, [[Major League Soccer]] side [[LA Galaxy]] announced that they would host América in a friendly match.<ref>{{Cite web|date=9 June 2026|title=LA Galaxy to Host Liga MX Side Club América in Summer Friendly on July 11 |url=https://www.lagalaxy.com/news/la-galaxy-to-host-liga-mx-side-club-america-in-summer-friendly-on-july-11|website=|publisher=LA Galaxy}}</ref> On 18 June, [[Club Jaiba Brava|Jaiba Brava]] announced they would host América at the [[Estadio Tamaulipas]] ahead of their season.<ref>{{Cite web|last1=Héctor Rivera|date=18 June 2026|title=¡Viene el América al Estadio Tamaulipas! Fecha, precios y preventa del partido vs Jaiba Brava|url=https://oem.com.mx/elsoldetampico/deportes/viene-el-america-al-estadio-tamaulipas-es-oficial-enfrentara-a-la-jaiba-brava-del-tampico-madero-30629787|website=|publisher=El Sol del Centro}}</ref> On 28 June, América announced that it had played a [[Behind closed doors (sport)|behind closed doors]] friendly match against [[CF Trival Valderas|Trival Valderas]].<ref>{{Cite web|last1=Adair García|date=1 July 2026|title=URJC hosts Club América of Mexico at the Raúl González Blanco stadium|url=https://en.urjc.es/todas-las-noticias-de-actualidad/10979-la-urjc-recibe-al-club-america-de-mexico-en-el-estadio-raul-gonzalez-blanco|website=|publisher=URJC}}</ref> On 25 August, América's [[El Súper Clásico (Mexico)|rivals]], [[C.D. Guadalajara|Guadalajara]], announced that the two teams would play a friendly match at the [[Oakland Coliseum]].<ref>{{Cite web|date=25 August 2026|title=El Clásico de México returns to Oakland!|url=https://www.chivasdecorazon.com.mx/en/noticias/41334/El-Clsico-de-Mxico-regresa-a-Oakland|website=|publisher=Chivas}}</ref> On September 4, América announced a friendly [[Clásico Joven]] match against [[Cruz Azul]] at the [[Snapdragon Stadium]] in [[San Diego]]. <ref>{{Cite web|date=5 September 2026|title=America vs Cruz Azul in San Diego: The 'Clásico Joven' Gets a Rematch—When Is It Happening?|url=https://www.soyfutbol.com/en/news/america-vs-cruz-azul-in-san-diego-the-clasico-joven-gets-a-rematchwhen-is-it-happening-20260905-0003.html|website=|publisher=Soy Futbol}}</ref>

